    <title>Nginx_入门</title>
    <url>/2026/01/10/Nginx/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>#nginx #linux </p>
<ul>
<li><p>nginx及其模块的工作方式在配置文件中确定。默认情况下，配置文件名为<code>nginx.conf</code>，并放置在目录<code>/usr/local/nginx/conf</code>、<code>/etc/nginx</code>或<code>/usr/local/etc/nginx</code>中</p>
</li>
<li><p>in this case a signal is sent directly to a process with a given process ID. The process ID of the nginx master process is written, by default, to the <code>nginx.pid</code> in the directory <code>/usr/local/nginx/logs</code> or <code>/var/run</code>. For example, if the master process ID is 1628, to send the QUIT signal resulting in nginx’s graceful shutdown, execute:</p>
</li>
</ul>
<span id="more"></span>

<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">kill</span> -s QUIT 1628</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<ul>
<li>For getting the list of all running nginx processes, the <code>ps</code> utility may be used, for example, in the following way:</li>
</ul>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ps -ax | grep nginx</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p> [!NOTE]For more information on sending signals to nginx, see <span class="exturl" data-url="aHR0cHM6Ly9uZ2lueC5vcmcvZW4vZG9jcy9jb250cm9sLmh0bWw=">Controlling nginx<i class="fa fa-external-link-alt"></i></span>.</p>
</blockquote>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">#重启前不要忘记用 sudo nginx -t 检查配置是否无错</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> nginx -s reload <span class="comment">#每次修改完配置文件都需要重新启动nginx</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p>  [ !NOTE]不推荐使用<br>sudo systemctl restart nginx 因为这个样子会中断正在运行的服务，上面则反之  </p>
</blockquote>
<h4 id="配置文件的结构"><a href="#配置文件的结构" class="headerlink" title="配置文件的结构"></a>配置文件的结构</h4><p>nginx由由配置文件中指定的指令控制的模块组成。指令分为简单指令和块指令。一个简单的指令由名称和参数组成，用空格分隔，<strong>并以分号（;）结尾</strong>。块指令的结构与简单指令相同，但它不是分号，而是以一组被大括号（<code>{</code>和<code>}</code>）包围的附加指令结束。如果块指令可以在大括号内包含其他指令，则称为上下文（示例：<span class="exturl" data-url="aHR0cHM6Ly9uZ2lueC5vcmcvZW4vZG9jcy9uZ3hfY29yZV9tb2R1bGUuaHRtbCNldmVudHM=">事件<i class="fa fa-external-link-alt"></i></span>、<span class="exturl" data-url="aHR0cHM6Ly9uZ2lueC5vcmcvZW4vZG9jcy9odHRwL25neF9odHRwX2NvcmVfbW9kdWxlLmh0bWwjaHR0cA==">http<i class="fa fa-external-link-alt"></i></span>、<span class="exturl" data-url="aHR0cHM6Ly9uZ2lueC5vcmcvZW4vZG9jcy9odHRwL25neF9odHRwX2NvcmVfbW9kdWxlLmh0bWwjc2VydmVy">服务器<i class="fa fa-external-link-alt"></i></span>和<span class="exturl" data-url="aHR0cHM6Ly9uZ2lueC5vcmcvZW4vZG9jcy9odHRwL25neF9odHRwX2NvcmVfbW9kdWxlLmh0bWwjbG9jYXRpb24=">位置<i class="fa fa-external-link-alt"></i></span>）。</p>
<p>放置在任何上下文之外的配置文件中的指令都被视为在<span class="exturl" data-url="aHR0cHM6Ly9uZ2lueC5vcmcvZW4vZG9jcy9uZ3hfY29yZV9tb2R1bGUuaHRtbA==">主上<i class="fa fa-external-link-alt"></i></span>下文中。<code>events</code>和<code>http</code>指令位于<code>main</code>下文、<code>http</code>中的<code>server</code>和<code>server</code>中<code>location</code>中。</p>
<p><code>#</code>符号后的其余行被视为注释。</p>
<h4 id="主要框架"><a href="#主要框架" class="headerlink" title="主要框架"></a>主要框架</h4><ul>
<li>worker_processes</li>
<li>event</li>
<li>http{mime.types}</li>
<li>server{ listen;host_name;location}</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="location块里的方法名"><a href="#location块里的方法名" class="headerlink" title="location块里的方法名"></a>location块里的方法名</h3><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attribute">root</span> URL <span class="comment">#指定根目录</span></span><br><span class="line">rewrite DIR URL <span class="comment">#重写到URL</span></span><br><span class="line">return 状态码 URL <span class="comment">#重定向或者返回状态码</span></span><br><span class="line">alias URL</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>


<h4 id="location-正则表达式"><a href="#location-正则表达式" class="headerlink" title="location 正则表达式"></a>location 正则表达式</h4><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">#还没有公布，未学习到</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="案例"><a href="#案例" class="headerlink" title="案例"></a>案例</h3><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">   <span class="comment">#gzip  on;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="section">server</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">       <span class="attribute">listen</span>       <span class="number">8080</span>;</span><br><span class="line">       <span class="attribute">server_name</span>  localhost;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attribute">rewrite</span> /url/ /; <span class="comment">#会拼接root+/=/usr/share/nginx/html/</span></span><br><span class="line">       <span class="comment">#access_log  logs/host.access.log  main;</span></span><br><span class="line">       <span class="section">location</span> /&#123;</span><br><span class="line">           <span class="attribute">root</span>   /usr/share/nginx/html;</span><br><span class="line">           <span class="attribute">index</span>  index.html index.htm;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span>  <span class="regexp">~  /url/[1-2]</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">return</span> <span class="number">307</span> /;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span> = /image&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">alias</span> /usr/share/nginx/html/url/image/a.jpg;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">default_type</span> image/jpeg;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">       <span class="comment">#error_page  404              /404.html;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<blockquote>
<p> [!WARN]rewrite 的网页最好写绝对路径，重写浏览器只解析相对路径，只看浏览器的URL,也就是定义要重写的路径</p>
</blockquote>
<p><span class="exturl" data-url="aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cubmdpbngub3JnLw==">beginner<i class="fa fa-external-link-alt"></i></span></p>
]]></content>
